#: doctor-subs.php
#. Description of the plugin
msgid ""
"Find and fix broken WooCommerce subscriptions. Detects ghost subs, "
"stuck-on-hold renewals, and repeated payment failures, with one-click "
"reversible fixes."
msgstr ""
"Find og reparer ødelagte WooCommerce subscriptions. Registrerer ghost subs, "
"fastlåste fornyelser på pause og gentagne betalingsfejl med et klik for at "
"rette tilbage."

